{
    "key": "estate",
    "templateKey": "repobot-estate",
    "title": "Real estate agent",
    "description": "A real-estate agent site: a listings grid whose status badges (\u201cNew this week\u201d, \u201cSale pending\u201d, \u201cSold\u201d) and days-on-market lines compute themselves from the listing dates, neighborhood guides, the agent's story and credentials, and an inquiry form with click-to-call \u2014 a multi-page site edited in one content file.",
    "marketingExampleTitle": "Real estate agent",
    "category": "real-estate",
    "homePath": "/",
    "previewPath": "/estate",
    "homeViewDir": "web/app/src/View/Estate",
    "base": "landing",
    "clientOnly": true,
    "capabilities": ["IOS", "ANDROID"],
    "isDefault": false,
    "forms": {
        "$comment": "Managed-form kinds, formKey -> kind (append-only vocabulary: RSVP | LEAD | MAILING_LIST | PROOFING). Compose stamps these into repobot.deploy.json as formKinds; the dashboard renders declared kinds as typed views and keeps the raw Inbox for undeclared keys.",
        "estate-inquiry": "LEAD"
    },
    "theme": {
        "$comment": "The brownstone register's brand overlay: the preset's brick accent as the project brand, so app-side surfaces wear the same residential register as the marketing pages instead of the kernel default blue. Values match the brownstone preset's own light/dark accents \u2014 the marketing pages resolve brand over preset accent, so keeping them identical means the overlay re-brands the app without shifting the pages.",
        "brand": { "primary": "#9c4a2f", "primaryDark": "#d98a64" }
    },
    "contentContract": {
        "$comment": "The pack's content slots, as data (packs/README.md 'Content contract'). Declares what a composer (agent or tool) must bind for a generated variant of this pack to present as real: slot paths into the typed content module, their kinds, and minimums. The demo agent works Providence's East Side, but the slots are market-agnostic \u2014 any city's agent binds the same shape. Listing statuses and dates are content; the badges computed from them (listings.ts) follow wherever the data goes. Authored alongside the module and guarded by the pack's content tests \u2014 the module satisfies the contract; the contract never drifts ahead of it.",
        "module": "web/app/src/View/Estate/content.ts",
        "slots": {
            "agency.name": { "kind": "text" },
            "agency.agent": { "kind": "text" },
            "agency.tagline": { "kind": "text" },
            "agency.location": { "kind": "text" },
            "agency.phone": { "kind": "text" },
            "agency.email": { "kind": "text" },
            "agency.address": { "kind": "text" },
            "agency.license": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.subheadline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.heroImage": { "kind": "media" },
            "listings": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 4,
                "item": {
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "neighborhood": { "kind": "text" },
                    "price": { "kind": "text" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" },
                    "image": { "kind": "media" },
                    "status": { "kind": "text" },
                    "listedAt": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "neighborhoods": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "tagline": { "kind": "text" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" },
                    "image": { "kind": "media" }
                }
            },
            "metrics": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "value": { "kind": "text" },
                    "label": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "testimonials": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "quote": { "kind": "text" },
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "detail": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "about.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "about.photo": { "kind": "media" },
            "about.paragraphs": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 2 },
            "about.credentials": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 1 },
            "contact.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "contact.body": { "kind": "text" }
        }
    },
    "content": {
